OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared as     
OL,4,Ahospitals 'very busy'                  
OL,6,FDerby hospital bosses say additional   
OL,7,Fmeasures have been put in place to keep
OL,8,Fservices running after declaring a     
OL,9,Fcritical incident.                     
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and      
OL,12,FBurton (UHDB) NHS Foundation Trust says
OL,13,Fseasonal respiratory illness, including
OL,14,Fflu and Covid-19, is adding to         
OL,15,Fpressures which have led it to declare 
OL,16,Fthe alert on Monday.                   
OL,18,FRoyal Derby Hospital is facing the     
OL,19,Fgreatest operation pressures, said the 
OL,20,Ftrust, with its accident and emergency 
OL,21,Funit's waits averaging about nine      
OL,22,Fhours.                                 
